beaker is a C web framework vendored into this repository.

Upstream: https://git.bwaaa.monster/beaker
Base commit: acdd9e7 (see ../beaker.commit)
License: GNU Lesser General Public License 2.1 (see LICENSE)

The Lyra project has modified this copy for Seek. Changed files carry
a notice at the top naming the change and date:

  src/http.c      redirect responses send Content-Length: 0 and
                  Cache-Control: no-store
  src/routing.c   image responses send Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
  src/server.c    default 404 response is a Seek-branded HTML page

The modifications remain under the LGPL-2.1. Seek links libbeaker.a
statically; full source for both is in this repository, so anyone can
rebuild and relink against a modified beaker.
